  "run": "front, ChassisV11 brief, final front for the hairpin: the 4.5 m outside radius with the outer front tire edge on it needs a mean (two-track) road-wheel steer of 25.6 deg at low speed, declared on the axle's mean steer; Ackermann at that lock >= 75% (the dynamic hairpin target at 1.5 g); worst joint misalignment over travel at the lock <= 12 deg with bolt axes along the kingpin (outboard), the A-arm pivot axis (inboard) and chassis z (rack), in place of the link-swing bound, which counts rotation about the bolt; compliance steer in the 1.5 g corner within +/-0.08 deg at 30 kN/mm pickups in series with the 4130 links; the inputs of front_v11_29deg with the walls added (genesis_walls): straight-line deceleration at the 73% front brake bias >= 1.5 g; lowest link buckling/yield factor >= 2.0 under robustness.shock_cases('front', 0.73) with 5/8 x 0.065 in lower-rear and 5/8 x 0.049 in lower-front legs, 5/8 x 0.035 in elsewhere; rocker bearing static safety factor >= 2.0 for a 2 x SKF 6204-2RSH pair at 30 mm under genesis_repro.vehicle_load_cases('front', 0.73); anti-dive at 73% bias 63.6 to 70% (the front then holds to the peak mu the rear holds to, 1.83); a rack of 81 mm per wheel turn (76.2 declared before) with the wheel envelope swept to 27 mm of rack, the travel the 120 deg limit allows; started from the front_v11_29deg_walls winner (inputs 4f088b0e4609) by genesis_seed.seed_search in two stages: on an 80 mm rack swept to 26.7 mm (1274 evaluations, which stalled with the lock 0.39 deg of wheel over 120), then on the 81 mm rack (seed 1, 3 evaluations, clearance target 0.45 mm, final band 0.347); actuation then re-synthesised (actuation.synthesize_actuation, ride 2.6 Hz, 60.1 kg sprung corner, obstacles = ChassisV10 tubes at front axle station CAD Z 950 mm and ground CAD Y -76 mm; V10 node reach not imposed)",
